    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Slice, pierce, cleave, sweep, the blades flutter in lockstep with the enemy."
    },
    {
        "text": "Wail, rage, curse, howl, and then all tends towards the serene."
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis's expression holds not the slightest change."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Dealt with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "There's no front or ambush positions left. We can continue forward."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You do a pretty job, Feline. Settled it without any of us even taking a scratch."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "And you skewer their heads real fast, real precise, no hesitation. That's good form."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "If only we didn't know you killed the Captain, I'd probably ask you to join us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You're a natural-born warrior. Shame you're with that Cautus, damn shame."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You can't say bad things about Amiya."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "No, I'm not criticizing her now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "I'd been wanting to hear the things she said long, long ago, things I'd heard before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "She's great, Feline. A true great one."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "But this won't get you anywhere, Feline, it won't get you anywhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I don't believe you. Amiya will be able to do it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Maybe. But you, with her, it's no good for either of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You're two kinds of people."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "What two kinds of people? Me and Amiya get along really well. She's taught me a lot of things."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "...Heh, you'll figure in time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You're doing this on purpose... I don't want to know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "What you just said. I could join you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You can."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "We welcome anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "As long as you feel the Infected's fate is unfair, as long as Ursus gets you burning mad, as long as you want to fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You can join us, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You thought our team only had Ursus in it? Thought it only kept this country's people? Think again, Feline."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 3
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "...You're a Feline too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Born in Rim Billiton, went with my parents to Ursus, and settled down afterwards in this frigid place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "I liked picking fights ever since I was young. Decided to join the army later because of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Ursus's assessments for joining the army are pretty harsh on Felines, but I still passed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "And after, I joined the Captain's unit, and went with him, fighting campaigns far and wide. That was ten years."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Wars, following wars, and always a war after that. That's Ursus."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "I used to feel proud of this country, kid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Countless among us used to feel proud of this country."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "So, why...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Because my parents got Oripathy, got kicked out of the city, and died in the wilderness."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "And I only learned about it half a year after they'd kicked the bucket."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "...?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Countless among us have gone through something similar."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "I heard you went through something similar too, kid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "But it's not just that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "If it was just that, just the one misfortune I ever happened across, I might even be able to understand it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "But. That's not how it is."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "War used to be the only thing that existed inside my head, and the only thing I ever reckoned to accomplish."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "I started reflecting, thinking some things over, and only then did I start figuring something out about this country, trying to understand this country I used to struggle for."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "If the Captain weren't there, I'd have probably long been court-martialed for making disrespectful remarks at HQ."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "After that, I went to the Northern Plains with the Captain."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "And the rest is history."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "In all of this, I've learned endurance, learned rage, learned hatred."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "...Amiya told me not to learn these."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You'll learn them one way or the other, kid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "If you can't use them, chances are they'll swallow you up."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "So, was Patriot your family, then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "We fought together for twenty years. He was my best brother, my closest brother-in-arms, and the one I most respected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "He was, kid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "But I've still gotta say, you're all the more suited to join us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Then would Amiya be able to join you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "That Cautus? Nope, she wouldn't work."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "She can't join us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Then I won't join you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Hah. I told you. You killed the Captain. There's no way you'd be able to join."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I don't care."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "But personally speaking, you need to pay a bit more attention to her. She wants to protect you, but she'll probably die faster than you will."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Why are you that sure?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058_2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Because we've met someone like her before."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Shieldguard looks like he's thinking back to something. He pays no more attention to Rosmontis, puts on his helmet once again, and walks off to his comrades-in-arms."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image"
    }
]